{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝應許拯救祂的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對耶利米說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「以色列的上帝耶和華這樣說，『你要把我對你說的一切話寫在書卷上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華說：看啊，時候將到，我要使我被擄的以色列和猶大子民返鄉，回到我賜給他們祖先的土地上，恢復他們的地業。這是耶和華說的。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"以下是耶和華談論以色列和猶大的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我聽見驚恐戰慄的喊叫聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們去問問看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男人能分娩嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我看見男人們都雙手捂著肚子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像分娩的婦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臉色蒼白呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唉！無比可怕的日子快來了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那將是雅各子孫的苦難之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們必得拯救。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：「那日，我要折斷他們頸上的軛，砍斷他們的鎖鏈，使他們不再受外族人奴役。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他們要事奉他們的上帝耶和華，服侍我為他們選立來坐大衛寶座的王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「我的僕人雅各啊，不要害怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，不要驚慌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我必從遠方拯救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從流亡之地拯救你的後裔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雅各重歸故土，安享太平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不受驚嚇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我與你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要拯救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要徹底毀滅列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我曾使你流亡的地方。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我不會徹底毀滅你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會放過你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必公正地懲治你。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們的創傷無法醫治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的傷口無法痊癒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有人為你們辯護，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的傷處無藥可治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們無法痊癒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的盟友都忘了你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對你們漠不關心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像你們的仇敵一樣擊打你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像敵人一樣殘酷地懲罰你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們罪大惡極，罪過無數。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們緣何為自己的創傷哭泣？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的創傷無法醫治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們罪大惡極，罪過無數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我才這樣懲罰你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，吞吃你們的必被吞吃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的敵人全被擄走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擄掠你們的必被擄掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搶奪你們的必被搶奪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們被稱為棄兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是無人關心的錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要醫治你們的創傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們康復。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我要使雅各家被擄的子孫返鄉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要憐憫他們的家園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們在廢墟上重建城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在原處重修宮殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡必傳出感謝和歡樂的聲音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他們人丁興旺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再減少；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他們得享尊榮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再受歧視。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的兒女要如往日一樣興旺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他們的會眾堅立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要懲罰所有壓迫他們的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的首領將是自己的同胞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的元首將出自本族。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必帶領他近前來，他必到我面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為無人敢貿然來到我面前。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要做我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要做你們的上帝。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和華的怒氣必如風暴一樣橫掃過來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"颳到惡人頭上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華不完成祂心中的計劃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的烈怒必不止息。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將來有一天，你們會明白。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}